# undici is a transitive dependency of @actions/http-client
# which is maintained by GitHub. We can't easily update it.
CVE-2026-22036

# The CVEs below are all in undici 5.29.0, reached via
# @actions/core -> @actions/http-client -> undici ^5.25.4.
# Every fix is in undici 6.x/7.x/8.x, so there is no 5.x release to
# upgrade to while @actions/http-client pins ^5.25.4.
#
# All of them need an outbound HTTP or WebSocket request to exploit.
# This action makes none: it reads and writes package.json via node:fs
# and uses @actions/core only for getInput/setFailed/info. The undici
# code is present in dist/index.js because rollup bundles all of
# @actions/core, but nothing in this action calls into it.
#
# Revisit when @actions/http-client moves to undici 6+.

# Denial of service via WebSocket handling
CVE-2026-12151
CVE-2026-1526
CVE-2026-2229

# HTTP request smuggling / header injection
CVE-2026-1525
CVE-2026-1527
CVE-2026-9679

# Cookie parsing
CVE-2026-11525
CVE-2026-6733
